{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3248","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3248","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3248\",\"parent_revision\":\"431077b607c3c15086ad49425e9f75404489f59cce4c44fb177e19cdeadc4c20\",\"root_revision\":\"431077b607c3c15086ad49425e9f75404489f59cce4c44fb177e19cdeadc4c20\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-27\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nplugins/development-harness/agents/impact-analyst.md grants the SendMessage tool (frontmatter line 4) but its own instructions never tell it to call SendMessage to report completion back to the orchestrator/team-lead. Its \\\"Completion and risk\\\" section (lines 382-386) instructs writing an `IMPACT_RADIUS_COMPLETE:` line inside the backlog item's Impact Radius section for other teammates to read there \u2014 that is correct for peer-teammate handoff, but it is not the same as notifying the orchestrator that dispatched it.\\n\\nSibling grooming-swarm agents dispatched the same way (technical-researcher.md:183, fact-checker.md:107) both have an explicit `STATUS: DONE` message-back instruction and both correctly reported back when run in the same session. impact-analyst.md does not, and in the observed run it silently finished writing its section and went idle for several hours before the orchestrator manually verified completion by re-reading the backlog item directly, rather than being told.\\n\\nThis repo's own .claude/rules/agent-output-contracts.md states the required pattern directly: \\\"When operating as a teammate (spawned via TeamCreate), also send: SendMessage(to='team-lead', ...)\\\" \u2014 a rule impact-analyst.md's own prompt does not follow.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation \u2014 surfaced while grooming #3244; impact-analyst went idle for hours without sending an explicit completion report\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-27\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"3c1a8c33328f03ba53efc3bf3d32fbe805a39932167f8954fd60af472e42cc67\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRBa22A\"}"}